  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>新增更多不死圖騰</strong></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><span><strong>獄髓不死圖騰</strong>：由不死圖騰升級而成，可重複使用，可附魔。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e7e51699-0ddc-4d41-b28c-1dc053a55754.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"459\" height=\"136\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><span><strong>鐵魔像圖騰</strong><span>：使用時召喚一隻鐵魔像協助戰鬥。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><span><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dab432f4-1615-46ef-a46c-4f12709e743c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"460\" height=\"140\"></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span><span><span><span><span>以及其他一些圖騰。</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span><span><span><span><span>支援 Curios API</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>",
